UPDATE companies SET description='Mann Solar operates from Lancaster, Kentucky, as an American-owned provider of solar energy equipment and installation services. The company''s founding year and original founders are not publicly disclosed in its directory listing or website.

The firm''s core business spans two areas: turnkey solar installations for homes and businesses, and distribution of photovoltaic hardware. On the product side, Mann Solar stocks solar panels, server-rack and wall-mount batteries, racking systems, high-efficiency appliances, and DIY solar kits from manufacturers such as CW Energy and UZ Energy. The company also assists customers with USDA REAP grant applications. No facility square footage, employee count, or annual project volume is published.

Mann Solar''s customer base consists of residential property owners and commercial entities seeking to reduce energy costs through solar power. The company emphasizes the 30% federal investment tax credit and warns that recent tariffs on Chinese-made solar cells will raise system prices, positioning its current inventory as a cost advantage.

