UPDATE companies SET description='Market Source Restaurant Supply operates from Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, where Dick Curtis founded the company in 1986. The Curtis family had been active in the restaurant supply industry since 1945, and Curtis established Market Source, Inc. as a family-owned and operated business to serve the local market.

