UPDATE companies SET description='Marmon Aerospace & Defense Group operates from Manchester, New Hampshire, as a collective of six specialized brands including Marmon Defense, Harbour Industries, Marine Tech Wire & Cable, TE Wire & Cable, KITCO Fiber Optics, and CCPI Europe. The group is a subsidiary of Berkshire Hathaway and Marmon Holdings. While the company references over 70 years of collective experience, a specific founding year is not disclosed.

