UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1944 in Marshfield, Wisconsin, Marshfield Furniture has spent eight decades producing handcrafted upholstered furniture in the United States. The company began as a domestic manufacturer focused on quality and integrity, and remains headquartered in its namesake city.

