UPDATE companies SET description='Based in West Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Masterson Foods has built a reputation as a manufacturer of shelf-stable, hot-fill sweet and savory sauces. The company does not publicly disclose its founding year or founding individuals, and its ownership structure is not specified in available sources.

