UPDATE companies SET description='Matrix Medical Devices is headquartered in Mayfield Heights, Ohio, and was founded in 2006 by Stephanie Harrington, who serves as founder and CEO. The firm began as a regulatory and quality consultancy focused on helping medical device companies navigate FDA and international approvals.

The company provides a suite of services spanning regulatory strategy (including 510(k) and PMA submissions), quality system establishment and compliance, risk management, program management, clinical study support, and, since 2018, engineering and product development. Its senior team collectively holds over 125 years of medical device commercialization experience, and the firm operates with a scalable model that supports clients from start-up through post-market surveillance.

A noted client is Nervive, Inc., which secured a $3.1 million NIH grant with Matrix’s support. The firm also assists with domestic and international regulatory submissions, supplier qualification, and design transfer guidance.

